ankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-04T16:42:54-08:00","id":1504391,"title":"","content":"I saw the movie <i>The Adjustment Bureau</i> and I thought it felt very Sidereal. It's basically the story of stubborn mortals trying to escape the meddlesome destiny agents, who are similar to Sidereals but less powerful. I could summarize the plot by saying the destiny agents need to use Shun the Smiling Lady for their mission, but that Charm doesn't exist so they run around trying to keep two mortals apart the hard way.<br /> <br /> <br /> Edit: Here's a question: How good as an inspiration is Avatar: The Last Airbender? Not incl. the live-action adaptation(s). I feel a need to relax with some movies or TV. It kinda looks like the Avatar is in a comparable position to a Solar, with great magical potential but surrounded by hostile forces.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":896,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","user":"Erinys","date":". 03-04-2023, 08:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-05T14:27:27-08:00","id":1504489,"title":"","content":"Actual conversation with my spouse the other day:<br /> \u201dDid we call out RRR as an Exalted movie when we first saw it?\u201d<br /> \u201cI don\u2019t know but we expletive should have!\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11883-fencingmonkey","name":"fencingmonkey","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-05T15:07:16-08:00","id":1504493,"title":"","content":"What is RRR short for?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-05T17:22:34-08:00","id":1504518,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1467574-movie-and-cartoon-inspirations-for-an-exalted-game?p=1504493#post1504493\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What is RRR short for?</div> </div> </div> </div>It\u2019s not short at all, it\u2019s 3 hours long! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> RRR is an Indian action movie that came out last year and decided it wants very much to be in the dictionary under the definition of \u201cbombastic.\u201d It\u2019s about two guys who team up to take down the British Raj using the power of friendship and also machine guns. A guy throws a leopard at another guy. This isn\u2019t the climax of the fight or anything, it\u2019s just something that happens.<br /> if you\u2019re looking for larger than life characters stunting and progressing from \u201cthat guy sure can do a lot of leg presses\u201d to \u201cthis is the literal embodiment of a god and now he\u2019s glowing\u201d it\u2019s a good fit.<br /> <br /> ETA: to answer the question you asked instead of the one I thought I should answer, RRR was a working title that became the real title - the director and both stars are extremely famous and have \u2018R\u2019 names. It\u2019s a bit like making a movie called \u201cBay Theron Reeves\u201d and just trusting the audience will get it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11883,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11883-fencingmonkey","user":"fencingmonkey","date":". 03-05-2023, 08:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11883-fencingmonkey","name":"fencingmonkey","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}